#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid "We apologize for the inconvenience."
msgstr "Wir bitten die Unannehmlichkeiten zu entschuldigen."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid ""
"We are sorry to tell you that the seller %(vendor_name)s cannot fulfil your order "
"%(order_number)s. Your order with %(vendor_name)s has been cancelled and we have immediately "
"refunded the full %(refund)s EUR to the payment method you used for the purchase."
msgstr ""
"Leider müssen wir dir mitteilen, dass der Verkäufer %(vendor_name)s deine Bestellung "
"%(order_number)s nicht ausführen kann. Deine Bestellung bei %(vendor_name)s wurde storniert, und "
"wir haben unverzüglich die vollständige Rückerstattung von EUR %(refund)s auf das beim Kauf "
"verwendete Zahlungsmittel veranlasst."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/item_unavailable/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/item_unavailable/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid ""
"We have already refunded %(refund)s EUR (VAT and any shipping share included) to the payment "
"method you used."
msgstr ""
"Wir haben bereits automatisch die Rückerstattung von EUR %(refund)s (inkl. MwSt. und anteiliger "
"Versandkosten) auf dein ursprüngliches Zahlungsmittel veranlasst."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/amendment_applied/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/amendment_applied/body.txt
msgid "We have refunded %(refund)s EUR to the payment method you used."
msgstr "Wir haben dir %(refund)s EUR auf das verwendete Zahlungsmittel erstattet."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/subject.txt
msgid "We received your order %(order_number)s"
msgstr "Wir haben deine Bestellung %(order_number)s erhalten"

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/body.txt
msgid ""
"We received your order %(order_number)s (total %(total)s EUR). We will confirm it when the payment"
" is complete."
msgstr ""
"Wir haben deine Bestellung %(order_number)s erhalten (Gesamtsumme %(total)s EUR). Wir bestätigen "
"sie, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/payment_confirmed/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/payment_confirmed/body.txt
msgid ""
"We received your payment of %(total)s EUR for order %(order_number)s. Each seller will prepare its"
" part and you will get a message when it ships."
msgstr ""
"Wir haben deine Zahlung von %(total)s EUR für die Bestellung %(order_number)s erhalten. Jeder "
"Verkäufer bereitet seinen Teil vor, und du bekommst eine Nachricht, sobald er versandt wird."

